spans.s:
पिण्डित, अस्, आ, अम्, rolled into a ball or lump,
pressed into a solid mass; thick, massy, lumpish;
formed into a mass, heaped together, collected;
mixed, intermingled with; united; added, multiplied;
counted, numbered; (अस्), m. incense.

पिण्डीर, अस्, आ, अम्, sapless, juiceless, arid, dry;
(अस्), m. the pomegranate tree [cf. कृष्ण-प्˚];
cuttle-fish bone; sea foam.
